flowchart TD
    A[Input projected geochemical CSV] --> B[Quality control and positive concentration check]
    B --> C[Empirical normal-score transformation]
    C --> D[Experimental and fitted variograms]
    D --> E[Conditional sequential Gaussian simulation]
    E --> F[Inverse transformation to concentration scale]
    F --> G[Concentration–Area breakpoint]
    F --> H[Local singularity index]
    F --> I[Exploratory multifractal spectrum]
    B --> J[Binary anomaly label or proxy]
    J --> K[Spatial block cross-validation]
    K --> L[Random Forest]
    K --> M[MLP classifier]
    L --> N[Probability maps per SGS realization]
    M --> O[Probability maps per SGS realization]
    N --> P[SHAP contribution sampling]
    O --> P
    P --> Q[Mean and variance across realizations]
    G --> R[Multi-element coherence]
    Q --> S[Robustness classification]
    R --> S
    S --> T[Priority / resample / background candidate zones]
    B --> U[Normal-score correlation network]
